OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmainly dry evening and night with some
OL,7,Fclear periods. More cloud in the west
OL,8,Fat times. Winds will stay mainly light.
OL,9,
OL,10,CThursday:FThursday will be mainly dry,
OL,11,Fthough quite cloudy with a few light
OL,12,Fshowers especially in the southwest.
OL,13,FSome sunshine around too, best in the
OL,14,FBorders.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA dry
OL,17,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,18,Foccasional rain later. Saturday cloudy
OL,19,Fwith occasional rain then Sunday dry
OL,20,Fwith some sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
